  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: H12_4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: Over the next few days, my situation luckily doesn't worsen. And I learn
      to suppress any non-human thoughts or feelings very fast. The unusually strong
      sensation on the first day here remains an exception.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I quickly give up trying to find out more about Aphilia. My questions simply
      get dismissed or only answered vaguely.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I get used to my new routines here. Mr. Horse shows me the amenities and
      his favourite little spots in and around the palace.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I think I could get used to this royal life. Especially if I can live it
      with Mr. Horse by my side.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: At least for now.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d1cdacf9c9530b74b9973cee8a95af55, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dee7ba4cc27149aab6227678e1d62920, type: 2}
